    author: organisation:dwp
  body: |
    # State Pension Credit

    Independent project-authored discovery aid; not an official interpretation or entitlement decision.

    An entry point to the chapter structure, source terminology and scope of the published staff guidance.

    Source: [DMG Vol 13 Ch 77: Conditions of entitlement, membership of the household and normal amount payable, PDF page 3](https://assets.publishing.service.gov.uk/media/68401a731d85c6606009cce4/dmgch77.pdf#page=3).

    Inspect the original and adjacent pages, footnotes, effective dates and cross-referenced memos. Source SHA-256: `0528f2fb95ac3bd71bdff0d91cdaba5df76ab4260396ca99608c840004ff5708`.
