  route: question/pc007
  title: How can I trace an extract back to the original?
  type: Question
  description: Open a source page record, inspect its PDF page URL and file 
    hash, then inspect its is-part-of relationship to the chapter. This 
    establishes captured-byte traceability, not legal correctness.
  status: draft
  tags:
  - unofficial
  - project-authored
  - question
  references:
  - story/evidence-audit
  - term/capital-disregards
  - chapter/84
  - page/84/0035
