    title: 'DMG Vol 14 Ch 84: Deemed weekly income from capital'
    author: organisation:dwp
  body: |
    # How can I trace an extract back to the original?

    Independent project-authored discovery aid; not an official interpretation or entitlement decision.

    Open a source page record, inspect its PDF page URL and file hash, then inspect its is-part-of relationship to the chapter. This establishes captured-byte traceability, not legal correctness.

    Source: [DMG Vol 14 Ch 84: Deemed weekly income from capital, PDF page 35](https://assets.publishing.service.gov.uk/media/6a5e38bb8b7e4fa537e693d5/dmg-ch84.pdf#page=35).

